§§ `X23 — 29.3's accelerated vesting does not reach an employer that simply ends the Contract`

-- A member with 20 years' service: on a merger, 100% of the Policyholder's account
-- (60,000,000); if the employer instead asks to end the Contract (29.1(a)), 29.3 does not apply
-- and the member keeps the current 30% (18,000,000).
#ASSERT `29.3 — applies to a part when the Contract ends on` `the Policyholder ceases by division, merger or consolidation`
#ASSERT NOT `29.3 — applies to a part when the Contract ends on` `the Contract term ends, the Policyholder asks to end it, or every part has ended`
#ASSERT `29.3 — the Vested Account Value at termination, for` (`a long-serving member, as at` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, born` (YMD 1980 1 1) `, in Vietnam` TRUE) `with accounts` `the usual accounts` EQUALS 60_000_000
#ASSERT `1.25 — the Vested Account Value of` `the usual accounts` EQUALS 18_000_000

§§ `X24 — 12.4(a): premium paid between death and claim is kept`

-- Basic Plan, Sum Insured 1,000,000,000. 10,000,000 of premium paid after the death and before
-- the claim raises the Account Value from 100,000,000 to 110,000,000, which the greater-of
-- ignores; 12.4(a) adds back only premium paid AFTER the claim. Same benefit either way.
#ASSERT `12.4 — the death benefit payable, for` `a Basic Plan part in force since 2020` `and` (`an adult's death claim, part` `in force` `, account value` 100_000_000 `, crime by the Policyholder` FALSE) EQUALS 1_000_000_000
#ASSERT `12.4 — the death benefit payable, for` `a Basic Plan part in force since 2020` `and` (`an adult's death claim, part` `in force` `, account value` 110_000_000 `, crime by the Policyholder` FALSE) EQUALS 1_000_000_000

§§ `X25 — 14.1(c): the Company's own withdrawal to pay premium forfeits the loyalty bonus`

-- At the end of a grace period in year 2, 16.2.1(a)(ii) withdraws 3,000,000 from the Account
-- Value to pay the Basic Premium. 14.1(c) counts "withdrawals to pay premium": at the 5th
-- anniversary the bonus is 0 though every other condition holds.
#ASSERT (`16.2.1(a)(ii) — at the end of the grace period in insurance years 1 to 3` (`The position at the end of the grace period` WITH `insurance year` IS 2, `suspense premium` IS 5_000_000, `supplementary premium` IS 2_000_000, `account value available for withdrawal` IS 20_000_000, `basic premium due and unpaid` IS 10_000_000, `basic premium instalment` IS 10_000_000, `rider premium due and unpaid` IS 0, `the Policyholder registered to pay rider premiums from the account value` IS FALSE))'s `withdrawn from the account value` EQUALS 3_000_000
#ASSERT `14.1 — the loyalty bonus credited` (`A loyalty bonus review` WITH `Policy Anniversary number` IS 5, `in force and never lapsed or suspended in the review period` IS TRUE, `premium paid in full for every instalment in the review period` IS TRUE, `any account value withdrawal in the review period` IS TRUE, `current sum insured` IS 1_000_000_000, `sum insured at the coverage start date` IS 1_000_000_000, `account values at the last 60 Monthly Anniversaries` IS EMPTY) EQUALS 0
